Subject: [PATCH] cli: enlarge topology labels and keep client radio details in hover

Use larger client, mesh-node and quoted SSID names. Place identity labels
around nearby obstacles without moving nodes or hiding names. Reserve room
inside SSID bubbles for titles and keep band/channel details in client hover.

